@startuml
' Component diagram for Inject-Collect
!define AWSPUML https://raw.githubusercontent.com/awslabs/aws-icons-for-plantuml/v14.0/Advanced/AWSPUML
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Inject-Collect" {
  [Orchestrator] as Orchestrator
  [Injector Adapter\n(e.g., HTTP, Queue, Device)] as Injector
  [Collector Adapter] as Collector
}

database "Primary DB (Postgres)" as DB
cloud "Object Store (S3)" as S3
queue "Message Broker (Kafka/RabbitMQ)" as Broker
folder "Monitoring\n(Prometheus/Grafana, Logs)" as Monitoring

Orchestrator --> Broker : enqueue job
Orchestrator --> Injector : schedule/send job
Injector --> "Target System" : send payload
"Target System" --> Collector : response / webhook
Collector --> DB : persist result
Collector --> S3 : store large payloads
Orchestrator --> DB : read/write job state
Monitoring ..> Orchestrator : metrics
Monitoring ..> Injector : metrics
Monitoring ..> Collector : metrics
@enduml